  d24d9678d30516e4 t("A result is finished output, so it has no time in work; its own Created age stays. Two facts mean something: how many attempts its task took (×N from two, from the task the result belongs to) and which agent made it. A result that took ten times the usual attempts stands out (peerFence over the page). Lab results have no task: no ×N. Time is always the rightmost fact (owner, 25 Nov): ×N, then the agent mark, then the time, so times line up in one column down the list. ",Inter:$font.family,13:$font.size.md,r,align(l),lh(auto,1.23)) p(32,83) s(1240,hug:48) f[(49db9c3bfbcb300d,tok(fleet.fg-muted,#9A9A9F))] "note"
